    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nOutstanding 4 Bedroom Country Residence with Extensive Farmyard & c.8 Acres\r\n\r\nMayo Abbey, Co. Mayo\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional residential farm holding comprising a beautifully renovated 4-bedroom country bungalow together with a substantial farmyard, extensive outbuildings and c.8 acres of prime agricultural lands.\r\n\r\nLocated just 2 miles from the historic village of Mayo Abbey, this impressive property enjoys a highly convenient countryside location close to the N60 route, providing easy access to Claremorris, Balla, Castlebar and surrounding towns while benefiting from a strong agricultural setting in one of Mayo's most respected farming districts.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home combined with an excellent agricultural holding suitable for a range of farming enterprises.\r\n\r\nThe Residence\r\n\r\nThe dwelling has been recently renovated and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises:\r\n\r\n• Entrance Hallway\r\n• Sitting Room\r\n• Kitchen / Dining Room\r\n• Utility Room\r\n• Four Spacious Bedrooms\r\n• Main Bathroom\r\n\r\nFeatures Include:\r\n\r\n• Recently renovated throughout\r\n• New roof installed\r\n• Double glazed windows\r\n• Oil-Fired Central Heating System\r\n• Insulated property\r\n• Bright spacious accommodation\r\n• Countryside views\r\n• Excellent family home\r\n\r\nFarmyard & Outbuildings\r\n\r\nThe farmyard is exceptionally well maintained and includes:\r\n\r\n• 4 Bay Slatted House\r\n• 2 Dry Bedded Bays\r\n• Machinery Sheds\r\n• Storage Sheds\r\n• Dry Hay & Cattle Sheds\r\n• Silage Slab\r\n• Concrete Yard Area\r\n\r\nThe buildings are in excellent condition and provide outstanding facilities for livestock, machinery and fodder storage.\r\n\r\nThe Lands\r\n\r\n• c.8 acres of prime dry agricultural lands\r\n• Excellent road frontage\r\n• Well fenced and easily managed holding\r\n• Suitable for grazing, livestock or hobby farming enterprise\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights\r\n\r\n• Approx. 2 miles from Mayo Abbey Village\r\n• Close to Claremorris, Balla and Castlebar\r\n• Easy access to the N60 road network\r\n• Approx. 20 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n• Strong farming district with excellent agricultural infrastructure\r\n• Peaceful countryside setting with all amenities within easy reach\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for farmers, hobby farmers or those seeking a quality family home with substantial agricultural facilities in a prime Mayo location.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nSole Agent:\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\r\n\r\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\r\n\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\n\r\nThese particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      },
